# Flourish

> Flourish is a no-code data visualization and storytelling platform. Create interactive charts, maps, and data-driven stories - no coding required. Used by enterprise organizations, financial institutions, newsrooms and public sector bodies worldwide.

- A data visualization tool built for storytelling, helping teams create engaging, shareable content for reports, presentations, and the web
- Used across use cases such as financial and sales reporting, marketing analytics, elections, sports and others
- Create interactive, publication-ready charts with no coding:
  - Start with your data or use one of 50+ templates
  - Customize with animation, interactivity, and layouts such as small multiples (grid of charts)
- Publish interactive, responsive, and easy to embed visualizations anywhere - including in Canva and PowerPoint
- Flourish is part of Canva, supporting integration into design workflows


## Products

- [Data visualization](https://flourish.studio/product/data-visualization/): Create interactive charts and maps using no-code templates
- [Flourish stories](https://flourish.studio/product/data-storytelling/): Build multi-step, scrollytelling stories combining charts and narrative
- [Interactive content](https://flourish.studio/product/interactive-content/): Visualize text, images and audio with interactive templates including timelines, countdowns and quizzes
- [Flourish Assistant](https://flourish.studio/product/ai-assistant/): AI-powered guidance to refine visualizations using plain-language prompts, inside the Flourish editor
- [Flourish Connector](https://flourish.studio/product/mcp-connector/): Connect Flourish to Claude, ChatGPT and other MCP-compatible AI tools to create and edit visualizations from your own workflow

